From: wee8 maintenance <noreply@moonbitlang.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:18:18 +0800
Subject: Bound optional Wasm proposals in the custom wee8 runtime

Upstream-Status: Local runtime capability policy
Maintenance: Review optional flags and newly unconditional Wasm proposals on every V8 upgrade.
Tests: Feature-policy runtime guests and packaged proposal-policy tests.
Original-Recipe: c755c8163a2702c822eaf875ce52c1d02823e267 patches/wasm-feature-policy.patch

The custom layer owns a positive list of optional Wasm features. Keep modern
exception handling and Wasm inlining; reject legacy stringref and exception
opcodes. Imported JS strings use per-module CompileTimeImports independently.

Limit flags before C API initialization for decoders that read flags directly,
and cap both feature-set entry points so origin-trial callbacks cannot enable
an excluded proposal. Ordinary V8 retains its existing behavior. This enforces
the accepted feature set, not source removal or a promised binary size saving.

diff --git a/src/wasm/wasm-features.cc b/src/wasm/wasm-features.cc
index 17a038304fb747d1f55d43bf8fce919e725ea4a0..5d01cad037d1b142fac08d912cbf36a5e79f2212 100644
--- a/src/wasm/wasm-features.cc
+++ b/src/wasm/wasm-features.cc
@@ -3,6 +3,9 @@
 // found in the LICENSE file.
 
 #include "src/wasm/wasm-features.h"
+#if defined(V8_CUSTOM_WEE8)
+#include "custom_wee8/src/wasm-feature-policy.h"
+#endif
 
 #include "src/execution/isolate-inl.h"
 #include "src/flags/flags.h"
@@ -30,6 +33,9 @@ WasmEnabledFeatures WasmEnabledFeatures::FromFlags() {
     features.Add(WasmEnabledFeature::feat);
   FOREACH_WASM_FEATURE_FLAG(CHECK_FEATURE_FLAG)
 #undef CHECK_FEATURE_FLAG
+#if defined(V8_CUSTOM_WEE8)
+  features.Intersect(kCustomWee8OptionalFeatures);
+#endif
   return features;
 }
 
@@ -58,6 +64,9 @@ WasmEnabledFeatures WasmEnabledFeatures::FromContext(
     }
   }
   // This space intentionally left blank for future Wasm origin trials.
+#if defined(V8_CUSTOM_WEE8)
+  features.Intersect(kCustomWee8OptionalFeatures);
+#endif
   return features;
 }
 
